=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync review-timesyncd ------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. timesyncd's Set servers: a drop-in$
# with NTP=, which systemd-timesyncd uses in place of the$
# servers built into it, and a restart.$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Set servers ##################################################$
$
# Note$
# hardn's servers take the place of the host's own. Remove$
# servers puts those back.$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Server               192.0.2.10 by hardn$
   -  Server               192.0.2.11 by hardn$
$
   -  Write hardn's time servers$
      /etc/systemd/timesyncd.conf.d/60-hardn.conf$
      @@ -0,0 +1,3 @@$
      +# Written by hardn (NTP Settings).$
      +[Time]$
      +NTP=192.0.2.10 192.0.2.11$
$
   -  Restart systemd-timesyncd$
      systemd-timesyncd$
      $ systemctl restart systemd-timesyncd$
$
  Set time servers? [y/N, 0 or q]: $
$
$

